// 1927
[dbrow_1927]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,Abilities are a set of combat actions that you may trigger.<br>Abilities are more powerful and faster than your normal automatic attacks.

// 1928
[dbrow_1928]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,There is an ability tab for each combat style.<br>Melee, Ranged and Magic abilities are attacks that you can perform. Defence and Constitution abilities will help you survive longer in battle.
data=col12,1

