table=dbtable_40
data=col0,24
data=col2,1535
data=col3,dino_boss_miniquest_cutscene_01,Millennia ago, Gielinor was an untouched, unspoiled wilderness.,sound_49238,365,true,false,true,true
data=col3,dino_boss_miniquest_cutscene_02,Only plants and animals lived there, untroubled by language or industry.,sound_49239,20,false,false,true,false
data=col3,dino_boss_miniquest_cutscene_01,Only plants and animals lived there, untroubled by language or industry.,sound_2901,10,false,false,false,false
data=col3,dino_boss_miniquest_cutscene_02,Only plants and animals lived there, untroubled by language or industry.,sound_2901,20,false,false,false,false
data=col3,dino_boss_miniquest_cutscene_03,Only plants and animals lived there, untroubled by language or industry.,sound_2901,70,false,false,false,false
data=col3,dino_boss_miniquest_cutscene_04,Only plants and animals lived there, untroubled by language or industry.,sound_2901,245,false,false,false,true
data=col3,dino_boss_miniquest_cutscene_05,A handful of elder artefacts had been discarded by the Elder Gods.,sound_49241,295,false,true,true,true
data=col3,dino_boss_miniquest_cutscene_06,One of these was the Codex, a repository of both knowledge and power.,sound_49242,375,true,true,true,true
data=col3,dino_boss_miniquest_cutscene_07,When a great beast came across the strange monolith, it couldn't know what awaited.,sound_49240,415,true,true,true,true
data=col3,dino_boss_miniquest_cutscene_08,It emerged from the Codex fundamentally changed.,sound_49243,245,true,false,true,true
data=col3,dino_boss_miniquest_cutscene_08,It was a colossus - an animal demigod. The ultimate apex predator. Unchallenged.,sound_49244,565,false,false,true,true
data=col3,dino_boss_miniquest_cutscene_08,When the dragonkin arrived, they were fascinated by the creature.,sound_49245,285,false,true,true,true
data=col3,dino_boss_miniquest_cutscene_09,They found it, captured it, and imprisoned it in their city.,sound_49246,285,true,false,true,true
data=col3,dino_boss_miniquest_cutscene_09,They called it Raksha. Nothing quite like it has been seen before, or since.,sound_49251,405,false,true,true,true
data=col3,dino_boss_miniquest_cutscene_10,It was not just a colossus, but a shadow colossus.,sound_49252,315,true,false,true,true
data=col3,dino_boss_miniquest_cutscene_10,Its power came not from the elder gods but from somewhere... else.,sound_49253,455,false,true,true,true
data=col3,dino_boss_miniquest_cutscene_11,To the priest Kranon, it was a religious inspiration, the source of his heresy.,sound_49254,425,true,false,true,true
data=col3,dino_boss_miniquest_cutscene_11,The scientist Kerapac took a very different line of inquiry.,sound_49255,325,false,false,true,true
data=col3,dino_boss_miniquest_cutscene_11,He experimented until the beast was of no more use to him.,sound_49256,305,false,true,true,true
data=col3,dino_boss_miniquest_cutscene_12,I recommend that you do not allow it to leave the complex.,sound_49257,265,true,false,true,true
data=col3,dino_boss_miniquest_cutscene_12,The damage it could inflict is considerable.,sound_49258,305,false,true,true,true

